        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini are strongly associated with linking TNF pathobiology to decisive therapeutic testing.",
        "maturity": "Long-term clinical use across inflammatory disorders provides exceptional confirmation.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Credit for the wider TNF biology and drug-development pathway extends beyond two investigators."
        ]
      }
    },
